>Did one small mini project on css - creating japan's flag only using css.

HTML: 

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="outer">
        <div class="inner">
            
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>


CSS:

.outer{
    height: 200px;
    width: 400px;
    border: solid black 2px;
    position: relative;
    left: 500px;
    top: 300px;
}

.inner{
    border:solid black 1px;
    height: 100px;
    width: 100px;
    border-radius: 100%;
    position:absolute;
    top: 50px;
    left: 150px;
    background-color: red;
}
